                            "playtime_at_review": 18,
                            "last_played": 1792812381
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of my old favorites on the Sega Genesis, which is highly underrated. I was excited to play the original DOS version and it has some strengths and weaknesses over the Sega version. On the positive, it runs much better without all the slowdown that plagued the Sega version. The Sega version does have slightly better graphics and great music, this version having NO music at all is a disappointment. For either version this is a lengthy and challenging classic action RPG which is pretty grueling by modern standards, but a lot of fun if you're looking for something old-school to sink your teeth into!",
